<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Failed</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/form-style2.css">
  <style>
    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff4b5c, #ff758f);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    a {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: white;
      color: #ff4b5c;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    a:hover {
      background: #ff4b5c;
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>❌ Payment Failed</h1>
  <p>Oops! Something went wrong with your payment.</p>
  <p>Please try again or contact support if the issue persists.</p>
  <a href="/form">Retry Booking</a>
</body>
</html>